Use common dw_edma_core_start() for both eDMA and HDMA. Remove .start()
callback functions at eDMA and HDMA.

Tested-by: Koichiro Den <den@valinux.co.jp>
Tested-By: Devendra Verma <devendra.verma@amd.com>
